OL,3,GNEWSAMeningitis survivor left with open
OL,4,Awounds for three years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man from Kent said his husband has
OL,7,Fbeen left suffering with open wounds
OL,8,Ffor almost three years after both feet
OL,9,Fwere amputated following a meningitis
OL,10,Finfection.
OL,12,FDavid Ferguson from Whitstable was 53
OL,13,Fwhen he was diagnosed with pneumococcal
OL,14,Fmeningitis in January 2024.
OL,16,FHis husband Russell Wilson has accused
OL,17,Fthe NHS of failing to provide a
OL,18,Fcoordinated plan for his care, saying
OL,19,Fit was "like watching a car crash
OL,20,Fhappen in slow motion... the longer
OL,21,Fthis goes on, the less chance he's got
OL,22,Fof recovering".
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
